<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;VALAIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Valais is a picturesque Swiss canton located in the heart of the Alps, known for its rich cultural heritage and historical significance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sion is a historic city in the Valais region, home to the Roman Catholic Diocese of Sion and the Sion Cathedral."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROMAN CATHOLIC DIOCESE OF SION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Roman Catholic Diocese of Sion is a vital institution in the region's spiritual life, led by Bishop Pierre d'Oron since 2014."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BISHOP PIERRE D'ORON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bishop Pierre d'Oron is the current leader of the Roman Catholic Diocese of Sion, known for his deep devotion to his faith and tireless work in the community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BISHOP NORBERT BRUNNER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bishop Norbert Brunner was the previous Bishop of Sion before Pierre d'Oron took over in 2014."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VATICAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Vatican is the center of the Roman Catholic Church and announced the appointment of Pierre d'Oron as the new Bishop of Sion in 2014."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LYON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lyon is the birthplace of Pierre d'Oron, a French city known for its rich history and cultural significance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRENCH NATIONAL ASSEMBLY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The French National Assembly is a political body where Pierre d'Oron serves as a member, representing his constituency with a focus on social justice and human rights."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOURNAL OF CHURCH AND STATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Journal of Church and State published a study in 2015 highlighting the impact of Pierre d'Oron's leadership on French politics."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARIE-PIERRE DUPONT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Marie-Pierre Dupont is a French journalist and author who wrote a biography on Pierre d'Oron in 2018."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LE MONDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Le Monde is a French newspaper that highlighted Pierre d'Oron's efforts in promoting interfaith dialogue and understanding."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SION CATHEDRAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sion Cathedral is a magnificent Gothic edifice dating back to the 13th century, located in the historic city of Sion."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ECUMENICAL DIALOGUE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ecumenical Dialogue refers to the promotion of greater understanding and cooperation between different Christian denominations, a key initiative of Bishop d'Oron."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOCIAL JUSTICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Social Justice is a commitment to advocating for the rights of the marginalized and vulnerable, particularly in the areas of education and healthcare, a key focus of Bishop d'Oron's work."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARGINALIZED AND VULNERABLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Marginalized and Vulnerable refers to groups in society who require special attention and support, a key area of focus for Bishop d'Oron's advocacy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EDUCATION AND HEALTHCARE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Education and Healthcare are key areas where Bishop d'Oron advocates for the rights of the marginalized and vulnerable, reflecting his commitment to social justice."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESTORATION OF THE SION CATHEDRAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Restoration of the Sion Cathedral is an ambitious project spanning several years, preserving an important piece of Valais' cultural heritage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AURÉLIE BARBEY&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
      <data key="d1">"Aurélie Barbey wrote an article about Pierre d'Oron, providing insight into his life and work."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PIERRE D'ORON&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
      <data key="d1">"Aurélie Barbey wrote an article about Pierre d'Oron, providing insight into his life and work."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BISHOP&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pierre d'Oron held the position of Bishop, indicating his religious leadership."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FAITH&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pierre d'Oron integrated faith into his political activities, showing the intersection of religious and political roles."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLITICS&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pierre d'Oron integrated politics into his religious activities, showing the intersection of religious and political roles."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ARTICLE&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0488</data>
      <data key="d1">"Le Monde published an article, which is a form of content they produce."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
